    <bpmn:documentation>Somebody with an account: a username and a password or Google. Everything a visitor can do, plus saves that follow them, lists of their own, keeping other people's lists, discount codes, a page under their name, and splitwise and flashcards (each drawn on its own).</bpmn:documentation>
